# Placeholder — replace with the real README centerpiece demo
# (up foo -g → x → open https://foo.app.test → status → destroy).
# `just tapes` puts the current debug build of `devconcurrent` on PATH.

Output docs/src/demos/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='> '; clear"
Enter
Show

Type "devconcurrent --help"
Enter
Sleep 4s
